Key Differences: Valkey vs Central Cache Service
Feature	Valkey (Pub/Sub)	Central Cache Service
Purpose	Real-time signaling	Persistent data storage
Data Type	Ephemeral messages	Key-value cache
Persistence	No (in-memory only)	Yes (Glide backend)
Access Pattern	Pub/Sub broadcast	HTTP REST API
Scope	Cross-worker coordination	Multi-tenant cache
